# smriti-ai Environment Variables

# Get your free Gemini API key at: https://aistudio.google.com
# 1. Sign in with Google
# 2. Click "Get API Key" in the left sidebar
# 3. Create a new API key
# 4. Copy it below (starts with AIza...)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# IMPORTANT: Never commit this file with your actual API key
# The .gitignore file excludes .env.local from commits
